---
description: Phone page (/play) and host page
globs: web/play/**,web/host/**,web/lib/nick.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

See [ARCHITECTURE §4–5](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) [ROUND_STATE_MACHINE](../../docs/ROUND_STATE_MACHINE.md), and [CONTRACTS](../../docs/CONTRACTS.md).

- `/play` writes only own nick, own role's choice, own rating (write-once). Never write round state or slots.
- `/host` is the sole writer of round state; re-derive state from timestamps on load (refresh-safe).
- Large one-handed touch targets, `navigator.vibrate` haptics, no app, no account.
- One tap = one tiny discrete write; no drag streams.
- Nicknames: blocklist + length limit before write; they never go to AI calls.
- Countdown derives from server time (`serverNow()`), never client clocks alone.
